Squashed from Leaf ver/26.3 (Winds-Studio/Leaf@60c5729), minecraft patches:

- Gale configuration (Martijn Muijsers)
- Leaf config (Dreeam)
- Leaf Commands (Dreeam)
- Configurable vanilla profiler (Dreeam)

